        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Talking Smack\n- Companies: WWE, WWE Network\n- People: Daniel Bryan, Shane McMahon, The Miz, Jerry Lawler, Michael Gregory Mizanin\n- Roles: hosts, professional wrestler, reality television star, actor, Intercontinental Champion\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Gregory Mizanin was born on October 8, 1980.\n- Michael Gregory Mizanin is an American professional wrestler, reality television star, and actor.\n- WWE produces Talking Smack, an American talk show that currently airs on WWE's subscription-based streaming service, the WWE Network.\n- Past hosts of Talking Smack have included Daniel Bryan, Shane McMahon, The Miz, and Jerry Lawler.\n- Michael Gregory Mizanin performs in WWE on the Raw brand under the ring name The Miz.\n- Michael Gregory Mizanin is the current WWE Intercontinental Champion in his seventh reign.",
